# ============================================================
# 保密纪律：内部决策与计划不入库、不上传
# ============================================================
# 内部文档（决策、计划、研究笔记、会议记录）
docs/private/
docs/internal/
docs/planning/
docs/decisions/
*.private.md
*.internal.md
*.planning.md
*.notes.md

# 研究草稿与未发表材料
docs/research/
research/
drafts/
papers/
manuscripts/

# 实验原始数据（大文件不入库，只保留 notes 和 config）
experiments/**/results.csv
experiments/**/*.npy
experiments/**/*.npz
experiments/**/*.png
experiments/**/*.svg
experiments/**/raw/
!experiments/**/notes.md
!experiments/**/config.yaml

